      {
        "id": "onehot-cosine-zero",
        "moduleId": "motivation-and-onehot",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "独热向量为什么表达不了相似度",
        "markdown": "对向量 $\\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{y} \\in \\mathbb{R}^d$，余弦相似度是它们之间夹角的余弦：$\\frac{\\mathbf{x}^\\top \\mathbf{y}}{\\|\\mathbf{x}\\|\\,\\|\\mathbf{y}\\|} \\in [-1, 1]$。任意两个不同词的独热向量只有一位不同，点积为 $0$，因此余弦相似度恒为 $0$，独热向量无法编码词与词之间的相似性。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000119"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "自然语言处理：预训练",
                "词嵌入（word2vec）"
              ],
              "lineStart": 27143,
              "lineEnd": 27346,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0007/images/8a0a56cfb14e9fe1299cfd0e65b07805f10837a308b61d609220cf23c029616a.jpg",
                "parts/part-0007/images/d8b9b9222ba7ebb1cd777021aa3bbf5dee748eae6d8b1ebc27338e811a6671eb.jpg",
                "parts/part-0007/images/fff1d767018b37c8c3a770b9a20a200163e644a9d876b10ccc9a32146a3891f5.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "537217449dac97755c25bb1ead67e134f6672120b944c32d9c9524621eb7e9c0"
