      {
        "id": "cbow-training",
        "moduleId": "cbow-contrast",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "CBOW 的训练与词表示选择",
        "markdown": "CBOW 的最大似然估计等价于最小化 $ -\\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\log P(w^{(t)} \\mid w^{(t-m)}, \\ldots, w^{(t-1)}, w^{(t+1)}, \\ldots, w^{(t+m)})$。由 $\\log P(w_c \\mid \\mathcal{W}_o) = \\mathbf{u}_c^\\top \\bar{\\mathbf{v}}_o - \\log\\left(\\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{V}} \\exp(\\mathbf{u}_i^\\top \\bar{\\mathbf{v}}_o)\\right)$，对任意上下文词向量求导得 $\\frac{\\partial \\log P(w_c \\mid \\mathcal{W}_o)}{\\partial \\mathbf{v}_{o_i}} = \\frac{1}{2m}\\left(\\mathbf{u}_c - \\sum_{j \\in \\mathcal{V}} P(w_j \\mid \\mathcal{W}_o)\\,\\mathbf{u}_j\\right)$。与跳元模型不同，连续词袋模型通常使用上下文词向量作为词表示。",
